compute_chunk_size: 10, nchunks 1
--- domain.hdf
points                 96
cells                  40
cell types             QUAD=40
connectivity in range  OK
offsets consistent     OK
orphan points          OK
vertex ordering        OK
u == cell centroid     OK
levels present         [3, 4]
f == cell level        OK
p (pid) values         [0, 1, 2, 3]
cells inside box       OK
verdict                PASS
